              f"- [{base}/ip]({base}/ip) — Caller-IP echo (ipify-style) + minimal node showcase — the zero-friction entry step",
              f"- [{base}/sample]({base}/sample) — Preview de dados reais (Fear&Greed + Sinais + Anomalias)",
